---
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#000000">
  <meta name="description" content="사용자 경험을 더 쉽게 연결하는 프론트엔드 개발자 김선아의 현대오토에버 지원 포트폴리오입니다.">
  <title>김선아 | 현대오토에버 포트폴리오</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: dark;
      font-family: Inter, "Noto Sans KR", "Apple SD Gothic Neo", sans-serif;
      color: #f5f5f5;
      background: #000;
      font-synthesis: none;
      text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      --canvas: #000;
      --text: #f5f5f5;
      --body: #c4c4c4;
      --muted: #858585;
      --line: #292929;
      --gutter: clamp(22px, 5.5vw, 88px);
      --content: 1440px;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; scroll-padding-top: 92px; }
    body { margin: 0; min-width: 320px; background: var(--canvas); }
    a { color: inherit; }
    button { font: inherit; }
    .page { overflow: clip; }
    .wrap { width: min(100% - var(--gutter) * 2, var(--content)); margin-inline: auto; }
    .site-header { position: relative; z-index: 5; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .header-inner { min-height: 82px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 28px; }
    .identity { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px; min-width: 0; text-decoration: none; }
    .identity-logo { display: block; width: 150px; height: auto; filter: grayscale(1) invert(1); }
    .identity-name { padding-left: 18px; border-left: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--body); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .16em; white-space: nowrap; }
    .nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: clamp(20px, 3vw, 46px); }
    .nav a, .eyebrow, .section-label, .project-meta, .fact-label, .footer-note {
      font-size: 10px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .nav a { color: var(--body); text-decoration: none; }
    .nav a:hover, .text-link:hover { color: var(--text); }
    .outline-link { min-height: 42px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 0 20px; border: 1px solid #777; border-radius: 999px; color: var(--text) !important; transition: border-color .2s ease, background .2s ease; }
    .outline-link:hover { border-color: #fff; background: #111; }
    .menu-toggle { display: none; min-height: 40px; padding: 0 16px; border: 1px solid #777; border-radius: 999px; color: var(--text); background: transparent; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; }

    .intro { padding: clamp(84px, 12vw, 172px) 0 clamp(50px, 7vw, 96px); }
    .eyebrow, .section-label { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }
    .intro h1 { max-width: 1050px; margin: 26px 0 22px; font-size: clamp(54px, 10vw, 132px); font-weight: 400; line-height: .98; letter-spacing: .11em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .intro-copy { max-width: 560px; margin: 0; color: var(--body); font-size: clamp(15px, 1.4vw, 18px); line-height: 1.9; word-break: keep-all; }
    .intro-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px 32px; margin-top: 42px; color: var(--muted); }
    .intro-meta span { padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .14em; }
    .hero-figure { margin: 0; }
    .hero-image { display: block; width: 100%; max-height: 820px; aspect-ratio: 16 / 8.2; object-fit: cover; object-position: 58% 46%; background: #080808; }
    .hero-caption { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; padding: 14px var(--gutter) 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 9px; line-height: 1.6; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; }

    .section { padding: clamp(100px, 13vw, 184px) 0; }
    .section-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(180px, .72fr) minmax(0, 1.28fr); gap: 30px; align-items: start; margin-bottom: 72px; }
    .section-heading h2 { max-width: 820px; margin: -8px 0 0; font-size: clamp(34px, 5.2vw, 68px); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.18; letter-spacing: .035em; word-break: keep-all; }
    .section-heading p { max-width: 510px; margin: 22px 0 0; color: var(--body); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; word-break: keep-all; }
    .project { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(300px, .8fr); align-items: center; gap: clamp(34px, 7vw, 110px); padding: 48px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .project + .project { margin-top: 28px; }
    .project:nth-of-type(even) .project-visual { order: 2; }
    .project-visual { min-height: 350px; display: grid; place-items: center; overflow: hidden; background: #090909; }
    .project-visual img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; max-height: 620px; object-fit: cover; }
    .project-visual.phone img { width: auto; max-width: min(62%, 380px); height: min(620px, 60vw); object-fit: contain; }
    .project-info { padding: 12px 0; }
    .project-meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px; color: var(--muted); }
    .project-info h3 { margin: 28px 0 6px; font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 48px); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: .04em; }
    .project-subtitle { margin: 0; color: var(--body); font-size: 13px; }
    .project-description { max-width: 490px; margin: 26px 0 32px; color: var(--body); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; word-break: keep-all; }
    .detail-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 100px 1fr; gap: 18px; padding: 13px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .detail-row:last-of-type { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .detail-row span:first-child { color: var(--muted); font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .15em; }
    .project-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-top: 26px; }
    .text-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-height: 42px; padding: 0 18px; border: 1px solid #555; border-radius: 999px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .12em; transition: border-color .2s ease; }
    .text-link:hover { border-color: #aaa; }

    .approach { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .approach-content { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(180px, .72fr) minmax(0, 1.28fr); gap: 30px; }
    .approach-content h2 { max-width: 850px; margin: -8px 0 0; font-size: clamp(34px, 5.2vw, 68px); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: .035em; word-break: keep-all; }
    .approach-content p { max-width: 700px; margin: 24px 0 0; color: var(--body); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; word-break: keep-all; }
    .about { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(180px, .72fr) minmax(0, 1.28fr); gap: 30px; }
    .about-copy { max-width: 800px; }
    .about-copy h2 { margin: -8px 0 24px; font-size: clamp(32px, 4.5vw, 58px); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.25; letter-spacing: .035em; word-break: keep-all; }
    .about-copy p { max-width: 650px; margin: 0; color: var(--body); font-size: 14px; line-height: 2; word-break: keep-all; }
    .contact { padding: 34px 0 70px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .contact-inner { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 28px; }
    .contact h2 { margin: 14px 0 0; font-size: clamp(20px, 2.3vw, 30px); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: .025em; word-break: keep-all; }
    .contact .outline-link { flex: none; }
    .footer { padding: 58px 0 28px; }
    .footer-inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; color: var(--muted); }
    .footer-note { font-size: 9px; }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      html { scroll-padding-top: 74px; }
      .header-inner { min-height: 68px; }
      .identity { gap: 12px; }
      .identity-logo { width: 112px; }
      .identity-name { padding-left: 12px; font-size: 9px; }
      .menu-toggle { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
      .nav { position: absolute; top: calc(100% + 1px); left: 0; right: 0; display: none; align-items: stretch; gap: 0; padding: 8px var(--gutter) 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); background: #000; }
      .nav.open { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
      .nav a { padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .nav .outline-link { align-self: flex-start; min-height: 40px; margin-top: 14px; padding: 0 18px; border: 1px solid #777; }
      .intro { padding-top: 88px; }
      .intro h1 { margin-top: 22px; font-size: clamp(42px, 11.5vw, 72px); letter-spacing: .045em; }
      .intro-copy { font-size: 14px; }
      .intro-meta { gap: 10px 20px; margin-top: 30px; }
      .intro-meta span { font-size: 9px; }
      .hero-image { min-height: 300px; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; object-position: 58% center; }
      .hero-caption { font-size: 8px; }
      .section { padding: 96px 0; }
      .section-heading, .approach-content, .about { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
      .section-heading { margin-bottom: 48px; }
      .section-heading h2, .approach-content h2 { margin-top: 0; }
      .section-heading p { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 13px; }
      .project { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; padding: 30px 0 38px; }
      .project:nth-of-type(even) .project-visual { order: initial; }
      .project-visual { min-height: 250px; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; }
      .project-visual.phone { min-height: 370px; aspect-ratio: auto; }
      .project-visual.phone img { height: 360px; max-width: 56%; }
      .project-info { padding: 0; }
      .project-info h3 { margin-top: 22px; }
      .project-description { margin: 20px 0 24px; font-size: 13px; }
      .approach-content h2, .about-copy h2 { font-size: clamp(32px, 9vw, 48px); }
      .about-copy { margin-top: 0; }
      .contact { padding-bottom: 52px; }
      .contact-inner { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
      .contact h2 { max-width: 500px; }
      .footer-inner { flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
      *, *::before, *::after { transition-duration: .01ms !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page" id="top">
    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="wrap header-inner">
        <a class="identity" href="#top" aria-label="김선아 포트폴리오 처음으로">
          <img class="identity-logo" src="/assets/hyundai-autoever-logo.jpg" alt="현대오토에버">
          <span class="identity-name">KIM SUNA</span>
        </a>
        <button class="menu-toggle" id="menu-toggle" aria-label="메뉴 열기" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="main-nav">Menu</button>
        <nav class="nav" id="main-nav" aria-label="주요 메뉴">
          <a href="#projects">Selected work</a>
          <a href="#approach">Approach</a>
          <a href="#about">About</a>
          <a class="outline-link" href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="wrap intro" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">Hyundai AutoEver · Frontend portfolio</p>
        <h1 id="intro-title">Kim Suna</h1>
        <p class="intro-copy">안녕하세요, 프론트엔드 개발자 김선아입니다. 사용자가 필요한 정보를 찾고 다음 행동으로 이어가는 흐름을 살피며, 더 명확하고 편리한 경험을 만듭니다.</p>
        <div class="intro-meta" aria-label="경험">
          <span>개인 프로젝트 기획 · 개발 · 출시</span>
          <span>팀 프로젝트 리딩 · 협업</span>
          <span>iOS · Android 서비스 경험</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <figure class="hero-figure">
        <img class="hero-image" src="/assets/autoever-mobility-mecha-hero.png" alt="미래 모빌리티와 로봇을 결합한 콘셉트 이미지">
        <figcaption class="hero-caption"><span>Mobility · Technology · Human experience</span><span>Hyundai AutoEver portfolio · 2026</span></figcaption>
      </figure>

      <section class="wrap section" id="projects" aria-labelledby="projects-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="section-label">01 / Selected work</p>
          <div>
            <h2 id="projects-title">사용자의 필요를<br>실제 서비스로 만들었습니다.</h2>
            <p>탐색과 비교, 감정의 기록과 공유. 서로 다른 사용자의 필요를 구체적인 모바일 경험으로 풀어낸 프로젝트입니다.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <article class="project">
          <div class="project-visual">
            <img src="/assets/templemoa-feature.jpg" alt="템플스테이 사찰과 프로그램을 둘러보는 템플모아 서비스 화면" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="project-info">
            <div class="project-meta"><span>Personal project · Released</span><span>01 / 02</span></div>
            <h3>TempleMoa</h3>
            <p class="project-subtitle">템플모아 · 마음이 쉬어갈 곳</p>
            <p class="project-description">전국 템플스테이 운영 사찰과 프로그램, 방문 후기를 한눈에 탐색하고 비교할 수 있도록 만든 모바일 우선 서비스입니다.</p>
            <div class="detail-row"><span>MY ROLE</span><span>개인 프로젝트 · 앱 개발 및 출시</span></div>
            <div class="detail-row"><span>PLATFORM</span><span>iOS · Android</span></div>
            <div class="project-actions">
              <a class="text-link" href="/apps/#templemoa">프로젝트 소개 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
              <a class="text-link" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.byeolter.templeguide&amp;hl=ko" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Play <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="project">
          <div class="project-visual phone">
            <img src="/assets/pheeeew-app-screen.png" alt="지도에 감정을 남기고 그룹과 나누는 히유 앱 화면" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="project-info">
            <div class="project-meta"><span>Team project · Released</span><span>02 / 02</span></div>
            <h3>PHEEEEW</h3>
            <p class="project-subtitle">히유 · 감정 공유 지도</p>
            <p class="project-description">지금의 감정을 지도와 그룹에 남기고, 메모나 음성으로 이야기를 덧붙여 서로의 마음을 나누는 앱입니다.</p>
            <div class="detail-row"><span>MY ROLE</span><span>팀장 · 앱 개발 · 앱 배포 담당</span></div>
            <div class="detail-row"><span>PLATFORM</span><span>iOS · Android</span></div>
            <div class="project-actions">
              <a class="text-link" href="/apps/#hiyu">프로젝트 소개 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
              <a class="text-link" href="https://pheeeew.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">서비스 웹사이트 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section class="approach section" id="approach" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
        <div class="wrap approach-content">
          <p class="section-label">02 / Approach</p>
          <div>
            <h2 id="approach-title">사용자가 다음에 할 일을<br>선명하게 만드는 화면.</h2>
            <p>좋은 화면은 정보를 보여주는 데서 끝나지 않고, 사용자가 망설이지 않고 다음 단계로 갈 수 있도록 돕는다고 생각합니다. 템플모아에서는 비교와 탐색을, 히유에서는 기록과 공유를 중심에 두고 각 서비스의 흐름을 만들었습니다.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="wrap section about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
        <p class="section-label">03 / About Suna</p>
        <div class="about-copy">
          <h2 id="about-title">아이디어를 출시까지 연결하는<br>프론트엔드 개발자 김선아입니다.</h2>
          <p>개인 프로젝트에서는 아이디어를 앱으로 구현하고 출시하는 과정을 경험했습니다. 팀 프로젝트에서는 팀장으로서 앱 개발과 배포를 맡아 동료들과 결과물을 완성했습니다. 현대오토에버에서도 서비스의 목적을 이해하고 사용자의 일상과 이동을 잇는 경험을 만드는 데 기여하고 싶습니다.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="contact" id="contact">
      <div class="wrap contact-inner">
        <div>
          <p class="section-label">Get in touch</p>
          <h2>함께 더 나은 서비스 경험을 만들고 싶습니다.</h2>
        </div>
        <a class="outline-link" href="mailto:contact@byeolter.com">contact@byeolter.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="wrap footer">
        <div class="footer-inner">
          <span class="footer-note">KIM SUNA · FRONTEND PORTFOLIO</span>
          <span class="footer-note">현대오토에버 지원을 위한 개인 포트폴리오 · © 2026</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>
  <script>
    const menuButton = document.getElementById('menu-toggle');
    const menu = document.getElementById('main-nav');
    menuButton?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const isOpen = menuButton.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';
      menuButton.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!isOpen));
      menuButton.setAttribute('aria-label', isOpen ? '메뉴 열기' : '메뉴 닫기');
      menu?.classList.toggle('open', !isOpen);
    });
    menu?.querySelectorAll('a').forEach((link) => link.addEventListener('click', () => {
      menu.classList.remove('open');
      menuButton?.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
      menuButton?.setAttribute('aria-label', '메뉴 열기');
    }));
  </script>
</body>
</html>
